<title>UK: Northern Ireland Elec appoints fin director.</title>
<headline>Northern Ireland Elec appoints fin director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Ireland Electricity Plc said it had recruited Nigel Wilson to succeed Gordon Woodworth as group finance director.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Wilson would join the company on October 1 and take over after a short transition period.  </p>
<p>Woodworth will stay with the company in a consultative capacity for a period up to his final retirement.</p>
<p>Wilson joins the company from Waste Management International, where he was finance director.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
